Section 7. Further Authorization. The members of the Board, the Superintendent of
the District, and all other officers of the District are hereby authorized and directed, individually
and collectively, to do any and all things, including making technical corrections or additions to
the text of the measure or abbreviated statement of the measure, that they deem necessary or
advisable in order to effectuate the purposes of this resolution in accordance with the terms hereof
and of applicable provisions of law.
Section 8. Effective Date. This Resolution shall take effect upon its adoption by the
Board pursuant to a two-thirds vote.
